# Day 47 - Content Intelligence Studio

## Overview

Content Intelligence Studio is a professional AI-powered content review platform built as part of the 60 Days Claude AI Challenge.

The application simulates a panel of specialized AI reviewers that evaluate content quality, engagement potential, conversion effectiveness, readability, platform fit, and overall content health.

Users can analyze text content, screenshots, thumbnails, and visual assets while receiving actionable recommendations, rewritten content versions, publishing guidance, and performance forecasts.

